WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.700
- So I am a flute teacher
for ages seven and up

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.180
at Wharton Institute
for the Performing Arts

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.950
in Berkeley Heights New Jersey.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.110
- That's amazing.
- I love my job so much.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.660
And I requested this song
because it really spoke to me.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:17.020
I felt like it really
was about missing someone

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.750
or the memories of someone

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:22.360
that you're not able to be
with in-person at this time.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.900
And I'm really feeling that

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.530
because I haven't seen
my students in person

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:28.650
since March of 2020.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:29.860
- Yeah.
- I've been giving them

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.530
their lessons on Zoom.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.160
So that's been interesting,

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.120
but I cannot wait to be
back with them in person

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.440
and give them big hugs.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.290
- Aw I love you so much and I love as well

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.560
that you use the word interesting.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:45.450
I have found more teachers
and parents doing homeschool

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.190
have used the word interesting.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:51.140
And interesting is really
just code for really super,

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.380
a word I shouldn't say
on television right now.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.224
But.

00:00:55.224 --> 00:00:56.600
(Kelly laughs)
'Cause it's hard.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.433
I am like whoa.

00:00:57.433 --> 00:00:59.510
- Girl, it is hard.
- Interesting isn't my

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:00.800
word of choice.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.870
It's just so hard to get
them to focus you know,

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:03.882
in general in the classroom.

00:01:03.882 --> 00:01:04.715
And then you've.

00:01:04.715 --> 00:01:05.548
(Kelly giggles)

00:01:05.548 --> 00:01:06.381
And my daughter does this thing,

00:01:06.381 --> 00:01:07.720
I don't know if any of
y'all have these kids.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:10.903
She's actually, it's quite
funny, she will do this.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:15.300
And just pretend that her screen.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.990
She's six!

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:21.008
She's six, and she literally,
I caught her just being like.

00:01:21.008 --> 00:01:21.841
(audience laughs)

00:01:21.841 --> 00:01:24.340
And she'll just pretend like she's frozen

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.390
so she doesn't have to do
what they're asking her to do.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:28.710
And I'm like I mean points for the comedy,

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:30.553
but reel it in dude.

